<title>USA: Genesis Energy LP Q4 full results.</title>
<headline>Genesis Energy LP Q4 full results.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the One Month Ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p> Revenues					     $  371,985</p>
<p> Income Before Minority Interests		    1,684</p>
<p> Minority Interests					  337</p>
<p> Net Income						  1,347</p>
<p> Net Income per Common Unit			     0.15</p>
<p>		     (in thousands except per unit amount)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said it only reported actual results for one month and pro forma net income for fiscal year 1996 because it was formed in December 1996.</p>
<p>Pro forma net income for 1996 was $15,889,000, or $1.81 per share, on revenues of $4.58 billion.</p>
</text>
